[{"answer":"Good morning, oh sorry, it's gone 12, I'll start again,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/1.mp3"},{"answer":"good afternoon, Kingswell Sports Club, how can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I was wondering if you could give me some information about membership and facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What would you like to know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have tennis courts, for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/7.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm afraid we don't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/8.mp3"},{"answer":"We're primarily a golf club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What about football?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I heard you had a team.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/11.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm sorry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps you're thinking about Fresham Sports Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I know it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I've played badminton there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/17.mp3"},{"answer":"They've got a lot of facilities we don't have and vice versa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/18.mp3"},{"answer":"We do have a keep-fit studio, which is very popular with members,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and then as well as that there's swimming, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good. I like to swim every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We have a range of classes too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have judo classes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm keen to learn.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, at the moment, we offer kick-boxing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/25.mp3"},{"answer":"We're planning to add judo and stretch classes soon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/26.mp3"},{"answer":"We're currently running a range of yoga classes, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/27.mp3"},{"answer":"What about relaxing after exercise?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I assume you have a restaurant or something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/29.mp3"},{"answer":"At the moment, we've got a salad bar which is very popular.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/30.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll also have a fully-licensed restaurant by the end of the year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/32.mp3"},{"answer":"What kind of membership are you interested in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... I'm not really sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/34.mp3"},{"answer":"What are the options?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there are three different membership schemes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I see. What's the difference?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the first one's called Gold,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can use all the facilities at any time of the day or week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/39.mp3"},{"answer":"You can also join in as many classes as you like for free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/40.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it very expensive?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you pay a £250 joining fee","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and then it's 450 - oh no, I'm sorry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/44.mp3"},{"answer":"it's just gone up by £50, sorry about that -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/45.mp3"},{"answer":"it's now £500 for the annual subscription fee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/47.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's the next type?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's Silver -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/49.mp3"},{"answer":"it's the same as Gold except you have to pay a small fee of £1.00 per lesson for any you do","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/50.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can only use the centre at certain times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I see. So when exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/52.mp3"},{"answer":"You can only use the facilities between 10 am and 4.30 pm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/53.mp3"},{"answer":"So I couldn't use the pool at 8 in the morning or evening, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/54.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. And the price for that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Is the joining fee the same as for Gold?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, it's slightly less than the £250 -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/58.mp3"},{"answer":"it's £225,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/59.mp3"},{"answer":"but the annual fee is only £300.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Does that sound more like what you want?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's still rather more expensive than I thought.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm a student here in England and I'm only here for six months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, then the Bronze scheme would probably suit you best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/64.mp3"},{"answer":"How is that different?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, some of the facilities have restricted use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And do I have to pay for classes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's £3 for each class you join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I see. And what are the hours then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Between 10.30 and 3.30 weekdays only","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/70.mp3"},{"answer":"and you pay a £50 joining fee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/71.mp3"},{"answer":"The annual fee is £180 -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/72.mp3"},{"answer":"it works out at £15 a month, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/73.mp3"},{"answer":"that would be quite a lot cheaper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that should be all right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/75.mp3"},{"answer":"I could come in my free periods.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/76.mp3"},{"answer":"What do I have to do if I want to join?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we book you in for an assessment with an instructor,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/78.mp3"},{"answer":"who will show you how to use all the equipment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/79.mp3"},{"answer":"If you want to organise a trial session and look around the centre,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/80.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll need to speak to David Kynchley.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you spell that please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, David KYNCHLEY.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/83.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll give you his direct line number.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/84.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 045895311.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you for calling Kingswell Sports Club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-1-2023-08-01-17-19-31/87.mp3"}]
